      "body": "The consensus outlook for fiscal year 2027 has been updated. 2027 revenue forecast fell from ₹14.6b to ₹12.9b. EPS estimate unchanged from ₹32.10 per share at last update. Pharmaceuticals industry in India expected to see average net income growth of 20% next year. Consensus price target up from ₹949 to ₹976. Share price rose 11% to ₹793 over the past week.",
